    "text": "Iudicia ciuitatis Lundonie.\n\u00d0is is seo ger\u00e6dnes, \u00fee \u00fea biscopas & \u00fea gerefan, \u00fee to Lundenbyrig hyra\u00f0, gecweden habba\u00f0 & mid\n\u00d0\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest: \u00fe\u00e6t man ne sparige nanan \u00feeof ofer XII p\u00e6ningas & ofer XII wintre man, \u00feone \u00fee\n\u00de\u00e6t we hine ofslean & niman eall \u00fe\u00e6t he age.\n& niman \u00e6rest \u00fe\u00e6t ceapgyld of \u00f0am yrfe, & d\u00e6le man sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feone ofereacan on III: \u00e6nne d\u00e6l \u00feam\nGif hit bocland sy o\u00f0\u00f0e bisceopa land, \u00feonne ah se landhlaford \u00feone healfan d\u00e6l wi\u00f0 \u00feone geferscipe\n& se \u00fee \u00f0eof dearnunga feormige & \u00fe\u00e6s facnes & \u00fe\u00e6s fules gewita sy, do him man \u00fe\u00e6t ilce.\n& se \u00f0e mid \u00feeofe stande & midfeohte, lecge hine man mid \u00feam \u00feeofe.\n& se \u00f0e \u00feyf\u00f0e oft \u00e6r forworht w\u00e6re openlice & to ordale ga & \u00fear ful weor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man slea,\nGif he eft ofer \u00fe\u00e6t stalie, agifan \u00fea magas \u00feonne hine, swa gewyld swa hine \u00e6r ut \u00e6t \u00feam ordale\nGif hine \u00feonne hwa forene forstande & hine geniman wille, & he w\u00e6re ful \u00e6t \u00feam ordale, \u00fe\u00e6t hine\n& se \u00f0e \u00feeof wrecan wille & \u00e6hlip gewyrce o\u00f0\u00f0e on str\u00e6te togeliht, beo CXX scillinga scildig wi\u00f0\nGif he \u00feonne mann ofslea on \u00fea wrace, beo he his feores scyldig & ealles \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he age, buton se cing\nO\u00f0er: \u00fe\u00e6t we cw\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t ure \u00e6lc scute IIII p\u00e6niga to ure gem\u00e6ne \u00feearfe binnan XII mon\u00f0um; &\n& h\u00e6fdon us ealle \u00fea \u00e6scean gem\u00e6ne; & scute \u00e6lc man his scillinga, \u00fee h\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re XXX\n\u00d0ridde: \u00fe\u00e6t we tellan a X menn tog\u00e6dere & se yldesta bewiste \u00fea nigene to \u00e6lcum \u00feara gelaste \u00feara \u00fee\n& hig XI healdan \u00fe\u00e6re hyndene feoh & witan, hw\u00e6t hig for\u00f0syllan, \u00feonne man gildan sceole, & hw\u00e6t\n& witon eac, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc gelast for\u00f0cume \u00feara \u00fee we ealle gecweden habba\u00f0 to ure ealra \u00feearfe be XXX\nFeor\u00f0e: \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc man w\u00e6re o\u00f0rum gelastfull ge \u00e6t spore ge \u00e6t midrade \u00feara \u00fee \u00fea gebodu gehyrde, swa\n& sy\u00f0\u00f0an him spor burste, \u00fe\u00e6t man funde \u00e6nne man, \u00fe\u00e6r mare folc sig, swa of anre teo\u00f0unge, \u00fe\u00e6r l\u00e6sse\nFifte: \u00fe\u00e6t man ne forl\u00e6te nane \u00e6scan na\u00f0er ne be nor\u00f0an mearce ne be su\u00f0an, \u00e6r \u00e6lc man h\u00e6bbe ane\nSyxte, emban urne ceapgild: hors to healfan punde, gif hit swa god sy; & gif hit m\u00e6tre sy, gilde be his\n& oxan to mancuse cu to XX & swyne to X & sceao to scillinga.\n& we cw\u00e6don be urum \u00feeowum mannum \u00feam \u00fea men h\u00e6fdon: gif hine man forst\u00e6le, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man\nGif he hine \u00feonne forstalede, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man l\u00e6dde to \u00fe\u00e6re torfunge, swa hit \u00e6r gecwedan w\u00e6s; & scute\nGif he \u00feonne o\u00f0seoce, \u00fe\u00e6t hine man forgulde be his wlites weor\u00f0e; & we ealle hine axodan.\nGif we him \u00feonne tocuman moston, \u00fe\u00e6t him man dyde \u00fe\u00e6t ylce \u00fee man \u00feam Wyliscean \u00feeofe dyde,\n& \u00fe\u00e6t ceapgild arise a ofer XXX p\u00e6ninga o\u00f0 healf pund, sy\u00f0\u00f0an we hit \u00e6sca\u00f0, fur\u00f0or, gif we \u00fe\u00e6t\nSeofo\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t we cw\u00e6don: dyde d\u00e6da se \u00fee dyde, \u00fee ure ealra teonan wr\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t we w\u00e6ron ealle swa\n& se \u00fee \u00feeof fylle beforan o\u00f0rum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re of ure ealra feo XII p\u00e6ninga \u00fee betera for \u00fe\u00e6re\n& se \u00fee ahte \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe \u00fee we foregilda\u00f0, ne forl\u00e6te he \u00fea \u00e6scan be ure oferhyrnesse & \u00fea mynegunge \u00fear\nEahto\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t we us gegaderian a emban \u00e6nne mona\u00f0, gif we magon & \u00e6mton habban, \u00fea hyndenmenn\n& habban \u00fea XII menn heora metscype tog\u00e6dere & fedan hig swa swa hig sylfe wyr\u00f0e munon, &\n& gif \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t gebyrige, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig m\u00e6g\u00f0 to \u00fean strang sy and to \u00feam mycel, innon landes o\u00f0\u00f0e uton\n& eac sendan on twa healfa to \u00feam gerefum & wilnian to heom fultum be swa manegum mannum, swa\n& we ridan ealle to & urne teonan wrecan & \u00feone \u00feeof lecgean & \u00fea \u00fee him midfeohtan & standan,\n& gif man spor gespirige of scyre on o\u00f0re, fon \u00fea menn to \u00fee \u00fear nycst syndon & drifan \u00fe\u00e6t spor, o\u00f0\nGif he \u00feonne ne m\u00e6ge, forgylde \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe angylde.\n& habban \u00fea gerefscypas begen \u00fea fullan sp\u00e6ce gem\u00e6ne, si swa hw\u00e6r swa hit sy, swa be nor\u00f0an\n& eac \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc o\u00f0rum fylste, swa hit gecweden is & mid weddum gef\u00e6stnod; & swilc mann swilce hit\n& we cwedon eac be \u00e6lcum \u00feara manna, \u00fee on urum gegyldscipum his wedd geseald h\u00e6f\u00f0, gif him\n& we beoda\u00fe eac urum hiremannum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc mann wite, hw\u00e6nne he his yrfe h\u00e6bbe o\u00f0\u00f0e hw\u00e6nne he\n\u00d0onne beode we, \u00fe\u00e6t binnan III nihtum he his necheburan gecy\u00f0e, gif he \u00fe\u00e6s ceapgildes biddan wille\nGyf he nyte spor to t\u00e6cenne, gecy\u00f0e mid a\u00f0e mid his III necheburan, \u00fe\u00e6t hit binnan III nihtum w\u00e6re\n& ne sy forspecen ne forswigod, gif ure hlaford o\u00f0\u00f0e ure gerefana enig us \u00e6nigne eacan ge\u00fe\u00e6ncean\n\u00d0onne gelyfe we to Gode & to urum cynehlaforde, gif we hit eall \u00feus gel\u00e6stan willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ealles\nGif we \u00feonne aslacia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s fri\u00f0es & \u00fe\u00e6s weddes, \u00fee we seald habba\u00f0 & se cyng us beboden hafa\u00f0,\nAc uton healdan ure wedd & \u00fe\u00e6t fri\u00f0, swa hit urum hlaforde licige; us is micel \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t we aredian\nNigo\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t we cw\u00e6don be \u00feisum \u00feeofum \u00fee man on hr\u00e6dinge fule geaxian ne m\u00e6g: & man eft geaxa\u00f0,\nTeo\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea witan ealle sealdan heora wedd ealle tog\u00e6dere \u00feam arcebiscope \u00e6t \u00feunresfelda, \u00fea\n\u00de\u00e6t \u00e6lc gerefa name \u00fe\u00e6t wedd on his agenre scire, \u00fe\u00e6t hi ealle \u00fe\u00e6t fri\u00f0 swa healdan woldan, swa\n\u00dee se cyng silf namode, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6ron w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00feas domas healdan sceoldan, \u00fee on \u00feissum gemote\nEndlyfte, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00feelstan cyng beot his bisceopum & his ealdormannum & his gerefum eallum ofer ealne\nGif eower hwilc forgymeleasa\u00f0 & me hyran nelle & \u00fe\u00e6t wedd \u00e6t his hyremannum niman nelle & he\nTwelfte, \u00fe\u00e6t se cyng cw\u00e6\u00f0 nu eft \u00e6t Witlanbyrig to his witan & het cy\u00f0an \u00feam arcebiscope be\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea, \u00fe\u00e6t him \u00feuhte & \u00feam \u00fee he hit wi\u00f0r\u00e6dde, \u00fe\u00e6t man n\u00e6nne gingran mann ne sloge \u00feonne\n& gif he \u00feonne on hand gan wille, \u00feonne do hine man on carcern, swa hit \u00e6t Greatanlea gecweden\nO\u00f0\u00f0e gif he in carcern ne cume, & man nan n\u00e6bbe, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine niman be his fullan were on borh, \u00fe\u00e6t\nGif seo m\u00e6g\u00f0 him utniman nelle ne him on borh gan, \u00feonne swerige he, swa him bisceop t\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t\nGif he \u00feonne ofer \u00fe\u00e6t stalie, slea man hine o\u00f0\u00f0e ho, swa man \u00fea yldran \u00e6r dyde.\n& se cyng cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac, \u00fe\u00e6t man n\u00e6nne ne sloge for l\u00e6ssan yrfe \u00feonne XII p\u00e6ning weor\u00f0, buton he\nGif we hit \u00feus gehealda\u00f0, \u00feonne gelyfe ic to Gode, \u00fe\u00e6t ure fri\u00f0 bi\u00f0 betera, \u00feonne hit \u00e6ror w\u00e6s.\nBe leode ge\u00feinc\u00f0um & lage.",
